-- Original (rbxassetid://4531551348):
--   30px row with .colorFrame (small square left) and .titleLabel
--   expands .colorPickingFrame below (170×120 when open)
--   contains .hueSatFrame (ImageLabel gradient), .valueFrame (vertical gradient),
